Package: codex-ubuntu
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Minh Vu <vuhoangminh97@gmail.com>
Depends: curl, python3, sensible-utils, xdg-utils
Recommends: desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, libnotify-bin
Description: Browser fallback preview package for Ubuntu desktop integration
 This package installs the browser fallback and recovery launcher for Ubuntu.
 It does not install the Electron desktop path.
 Today this package exists as the recovery and preview launcher while the
 Electron desktop path is still being productized.
